 jagged peaks, and overall environmental composition.\n\nThe road must remain the main path through the environment.\n\nRiven, Ally Soldier, and the allied military group are traveling along this road.\n\nDo not transform the location into a battlefield.\n\nThere is no active combat.\n\nThere are no enemies.\n\nThere are no burning villages.\n\nThere is no immediate danger.\n\n\n=== SUNSET LIGHTING AND ATMOSPHERE — IMPORTANT ===\n\nThe entire scene takes place during a beautiful late mountain sunset.\n\nThe sun is low near the horizon, partially framed by the distant mountain ridges.\n\nWarm golden-orange sunlight passes through gaps between the mountains and clouds.\n\nLong soft shadows stretch across the dirt road and surrounding grassland.\n\nThe warm sunset light catches the edges of Riven and Ally Soldier's hair, armor, clothing, and weapons, creating subtle natural rim light.\n\nMetal armor and weapons reflect small restrained highlights from the setting sun.\n\nDo not make the armor excessively shiny.\n\nThe distant mountains gradually become cooler, darker silhouettes through atmospheric haze.\n\nThin layers of mountain mist remain visible between distant ridges.\n\nThe sky contains a natural cinematic transition from warm gold and muted orange near the horizon into cooler gray-blue tones higher above.\n\nScattered clouds catch subtle warm light along their edges.\n\nThe valley remains realistic and grounded.\n\nDo not create an overly saturated fantasy sunset.\n\nDo not make the sky bright red or purple.\n\nKeep the colors natural, restrained, cinematic, and consistent with the dark realistic visual style of the film.\n\nGentle evening wind moves the tall grass, Riven's pale-blonde hair, Ally Soldier's clothing, and loose fabric.\n\nSmall amounts of dust rise naturally beneath the boots of the traveling soldiers and become briefly visible in the low golden sunlight.\n\nThe overall atmosphere should feel calm, vast, cinematic, and quietly beautiful.\n\nThis 